  "referenceNumber": "RUS3570",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that ANO STRATEGIC COMMUNICATIONS CASPIAN 2030 is an ‘involved person’ under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the basis that it is owned or controlled directly or indirectly by the Social Design Agency (SDA), which is and has been involved in destabilising Ukraine by engaging in and providing support for action which undermines the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. \n",
